    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "84a06f60_cd65f75c",
        "filename": "experimental/rust_jpeg/encoder/SkJpegRustEncoder.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 62,
      "author": {
        "id": 5642
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-14T18:13:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So IIUC `encode_jpeg` always premultiplies by alpha for `kBlendOnBlack`.  But if the source alpha type is `kPremul_SkAlphaType` then the components are already premultiplied and we end up applying alpha twice.  Maybe we should ignore/discard `kBlendOnBlack` if the source is already premultiplied?  The legacy impl seems to have similar logic:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/encode/SkJpegEncoderImpl.cpp;drc\u003dfc46d066b5b61503e660c9a25a8689f094ee9b04;l\u003d113",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "dcd6208b529ab94650e30bd2ae8e2a88567c34c0",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "85851bea_73a39c57",
        "filename": "experimental/rust_jpeg/encoder/SkJpegRustEncoder.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 62,
      "author": {
        "id": 4159917
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-16T20:14:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. The Rust encoder now matches the legacy encoder behavior: `kBlendOnBlack` is only applied for unpremul RGBA/BGRA sources. Premul sources already have RGB premultiplied by alpha, so we pass `Ignore` to avoid applying alpha twice.\n\nWhile modifying this path, I also added pixmap validation, checked row-byte narrowing, checked total byte math, checked APP1/XMP length math, and checked `SkWStream::write()` results.",
      "parentUuid": "84a06f60_cd65f75c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "dcd6208b529ab94650e30bd2ae8e2a88567c34c0",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
